{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 <strong>Wishlist Now</strong> \u2b50 \u2013 Gear up for the ultimate Mech vs. Bug arena battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2199, Mech gladiator arena fights are held to entertain the masses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867700/extras/bca04b8da7bae8e5cb0d2848455560e3.poster.avif?t=1769817987\" aria-label=\"Decorative image: Two mechs blastung through an arena full of bugs\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867700/extras/bca04b8da7bae8e5cb0d2848455560e3.webm?t=1769817987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867700/extras/bca04b8da7bae8e5cb0d2848455560e3.mp4?t=1769817987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast-paced <strong>single player arena shooter</strong>, you control two Mechs. One is under your full command. The other fights alongside you \u2013 either autonomously or as your remote-controlled gun arm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission:</strong> survive five brutal, randomized rounds in an arena full of alien bugs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you win, you're crowned champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(But you won\u2019t win.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Dual-Mech Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Control two war machines at once in a unique single-player setup</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Skill-Based Bullet Hell Combat</strong> \u2013 No buffs. No shortcuts. Just reflexes, positioning and target priorization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Arena-Style Mayhem</strong> \u2013 Fast, brutal matches where only mastery survives. Every round is a new execution drill. Hesitate once \u2013 and it\u2019s over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867700/extras/27365cc5b0f21df8211314d9b3ce1cc8.poster.avif?t=1769817987\" aria-label=\"Decorative image: Two mechs blastung through an arena full of bugs\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867700/extras/27365cc5b0f21df8211314d9b3ce1cc8.webm?t=1769817987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867700/extras/27365cc5b0f21df8211314d9b3ce1cc8.mp4?t=1769817987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Non-Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c\u00a0<strong>XP Farming</strong> \u2013 No grind. You\u2019re as good as your last run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c <strong>Skill Trees</strong> \u2013 Your brain is the upgrade path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c <strong>Unlockables</strong> \u2013 No skins. No hats. Pure Action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Glory awaits. But you won't see it.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867700?t=1769817987","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867700?t=1769817987","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867700/be0c32c11dbe1f63f2952ad2b579c945a1cc5ef0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769817987","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867700/be0c32c11dbe1f63f2952ad2b579c945a1cc5ef0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769817987","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Top-down arena shooter with stylized combat against non-human enemies (insects/\u2018bugs\u2019). Frequent blood splatter and combat effects, but no realistic gore or human violence."},"demos":[{"appid":3998170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 <strong>Wishlist Now</strong> \u2b50 \u2013 Gear up for the ultimate Mech vs. Bug arena battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2199, Mech gladiator arena fights are held to entertain the masses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867700/extras/bca04b8da7bae8e5cb0d2848455560e3.poster.avif?t=1769817987\" aria-label=\"Decorative image: Two mechs blastung through an arena full of bugs\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867700/extras/bca04b8da7bae8e5cb0d2848455560e3.webm?t=1769817987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867700/extras/bca04b8da7bae8e5cb0d2848455560e3.mp4?t=1769817987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast-paced <strong>single player arena shooter</strong>, you control two Mechs. One is under your full command. The other fights alongside you \u2013 either autonomously or as your remote-controlled gun arm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission:</strong> survive five brutal, randomized rounds in an arena full of alien bugs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you win, you're crowned champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(But you won\u2019t win.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Dual-Mech Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Control two war machines at once in a unique single-player setup</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Skill-Based Bullet Hell Combat</strong> \u2013 No buffs. No shortcuts. Just reflexes, positioning and target priorization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Arena-Style Mayhem</strong> \u2013 Fast, brutal matches where only mastery survives. Every round is a new execution drill. Hesitate once \u2013 and it\u2019s over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867700/extras/27365cc5b0f21df8211314d9b3ce1cc8.poster.avif?t=1769817987\" aria-label=\"Decorative image: Two mechs blastung through an arena full of bugs\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867700/extras/27365cc5b0f21df8211314d9b3ce1cc8.webm?t=1769817987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867700/extras/27365cc5b0f21df8211314d9b3ce1cc8.mp4?t=1769817987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Non-Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c\u00a0<strong>XP Farming</strong> \u2013 No grind. You\u2019re as good as your last run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c <strong>Skill Trees</strong> \u2013 Your brain is the upgrade path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c <strong>Unlockables</strong> \u2013 No skins. No hats. Pure Action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Glory awaits. But you won't see it.</strong></p>","developers":["Purple Tortoise"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867700/94dee0b9a4f594b383a167bf84a0b0470a82d1e2/header.jpg?t=1769817987","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3867700/293825815/ee1f0aaf961ee53b03223085a07b5dfc0870ff9a/1752220069/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755286156","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3867700/293825815/ee1f0aaf961ee53b03223085a07b5dfc0870ff9a/1752220069/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755286156","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3867700/293825815/ee1f0aaf961ee53b03223085a07b5dfc0870ff9a/1752220069/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755286156","id":257167649,"name":"Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257167649/b4c3b4781e02f57039b0a8c59e44bf782c71474e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755286156"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3867700/278542402/47d8f3af816aa33ccdf58daf124097823bf5e17c/1752248835/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755286157","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3867700/278542402/47d8f3af816aa33ccdf58daf124097823bf5e17c/1752248835/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755286157","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3867700/278542402/47d8f3af816aa33ccdf58daf124097823bf5e17c/1752248835/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755286157","id":257167821,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257167821/5f430cbf